The Great Gatsby.

110
00:07:48,195 --> 00:07:54,091
And if you'd like to hear the full story, the two-hour sleep version of "Tea Before the Parties" is on the channel.

111
00:07:54,285 --> 00:07:57,871
Thanks for studying with Unwritten Chapters.

112
00:07:58,177 --> 00:07:58,170
See you in the next one!

